# Evidence, not source. Skipped by ripgrep in every clone.
#
# These files carry worker transcripts, diffs and receipts. Even with the
# oversized strings extracted to sidecar .txt files, a repo-wide grep inside a
# worker's workspace has no business searching them -- and before this file
# existed, a single 288 KB JSON line tripped ripgrep's 64 KB record limit and
# spent a worker's whole churn budget on the resulting tool errors (V5-M9 x3).
